    {
      "anchor": "[spec-filter:AC-004]",
      "body": "## Non-functional requirements\n\n- The Filter block shall preserve the existing Visual Designer interaction and visual conventions;\n  conformance is checked during manual verification. *(S1)*",
      "bodySha256": "053067a501226f5b227158dc4d579981b2d8c2b819804f0a93dc1c43cb2462ba",
      "dependsOn": [],
      "id": "SPEC-FILTER:AC-004",
      "namespace": "SPEC-FILTER",
      "number": 4,
      "source": {
