      },
      "type": "AC"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "[spec-filter:REQ-008]",
      "body": "- The filter configuration shall be understandable from the rendered controls and shall expose\n  validation feedback for invalid or incomplete values; conformance is checked during manual\n  verification. *(S1)*",
